{"nodes": [{"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify_pipeline", "label": "Graphify Pipeline", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Steps 0-9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_fast_path_existing_graph", "label": "Fast Path For Existing Graph", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "line 53", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When graphify-out/graph.json already exists, rebuilding to answer a natural-language question wastes tokens and time; the graph is already the answer surface, so Steps 1-5 are skipped entirely and `graphify query` runs immediately."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_ast_structural_extraction", "label": "AST Structural Extraction (Part A)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 3 Part A", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Code is extracted deterministically with no LLM and no API key, which makes a code-only corpus free; it also means graphify never needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and must never block on one."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_semantic_extraction", "label": "Semantic Extraction (Part B)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 3 Part B", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only docs, papers and images need LLM extraction. Subagents must be general-purpose (not Explore) because Explore is read-only and would silently drop chunk files; all subagents are dispatched in one message so they run in parallel."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_semantic_extraction_cache", "label": "Semantic Extraction Cache", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step B0 / B3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cache entries are stamped with the SPEC_PATH prompt that produced them (#1939), so a prompt upgrade invalidates stale entries instead of replaying them; the cached file is deleted when empty so Part C never merges a stale .graphify_cached.json (#1392)."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_shrink_guard", "label": "graph.json Shrink Guard", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "to_json refuses to write a graph smaller than the existing one (#479) so a failed extraction cannot clobber a good graph; GRAPH_REPORT.md and the analysis sidecar are only written after the export succeeds so they never describe a graph graph.json does not contain (#1392)."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graph_health_check", "label": "Graph Health Check", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 4.5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Read-only gate that surfaces dangling, missing, self-loop and collapsed edges \u2014 the silent-corruption modes of incremental updates and AST/LLM id mismatches. It never aborts because the graph is still usable, but the Honesty Rules require the issue be visible."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_community_labeling", "label": "Community Labeling", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Communities are re-exported with curated names (#2490) so graph.json nodes carry community_name, and questions are regenerated after labeling because labels affect question phrasing."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_god_nodes", "label": "God Nodes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 4 / Step 9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_manifest_stamping", "label": "Manifest Stamping", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only semantic files that actually produced output are stamped (#2015) \u2014 stamping a doc whose chunk failed would mark it done and lose its content forever. Dispatched-but-unstamped files get their semantic_hash cleared (#1948), and manifest keys are relativized to the scan root so they stay portable across clones (#1417)."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_honesty_rules", "label": "Honesty Rules", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Honesty Rules section", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Never invent an edge (use AMBIGUOUS), never skip the corpus warning, always show token cost, never hide cohesion behind symbols, never visualize >5000 nodes without warning \u2014 the audit trail is the product's credibility."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_no_api_key_required", "label": "No API Key Required", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 3 preamble", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only GEMINI_API_KEY/GOOGLE_API_KEY are ever read; absent those the host agent itself is the LLM. Prompting for ANTHROPIC_API_KEY or any other provider key is explicitly a misread of the skill."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_interpreter_resolution", "label": "Python Interpreter Resolution", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 1 / Interpreter guard", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "uv tool, pipx, venv and system installs each put graphify under a different interpreter, so the resolved path is persisted to graphify-out/.graphify_python and every later block substitutes it for python3."}], "edges": [{"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify_pipeline", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_ast_structural_extraction", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 3 Part A", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify_pipeline", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_semantic_extraction", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 3 Part B", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_semantic_extraction", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_references_extraction_spec_extraction_subagent_prompt", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step B2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_semantic_extraction", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_semantic_extraction_cache", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step B0", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_semantic_extraction_cache", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_references_extraction_spec_extraction_subagent_prompt", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "SPEC_PATH note, line 220", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify_pipeline", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_no_api_key_required", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 3 preamble", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_no_api_key_required", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_ast_structural_extraction", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "line 157", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify_pipeline", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_interpreter_resolution", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify_pipeline", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_shrink_guard", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graphify_pipeline", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graph_health_check", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 4.5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_honesty_rules", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_graph_health_check", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/SKILL.md", "source_location": "Step 4.5 closing note", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_graphify_skill_honesty_rules", "target": "_claude_skills_graphify_